    {
      "content": [
        {
          "anchor": "overview",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Overview",
          "type": "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "ビデオ通話用のPicture in Picture(",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "AVPictureInPictureVideoCallViewController",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": ")を利用します。",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Picture in Pictureのウィンドウに表示する映像はSDKが描画するため、",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "アプリは画面上の表示領域(",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "sourceView",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": ")と表示する",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "RemoteVideoStream",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": "を指定してください。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "code": [
            "remoteVideoStream.attach(videoView)  // 画面上の表示",
            "let pip = PictureInPictureController(sourceView: videoView, stream: remoteVideoStream)",
            "pip.canStartPictureInPictureAutomaticallyFromInline = true"
          ],
          "syntax": "swift",
          "type": "codeListing"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "Picture in Pictureのウィンドウは映像の縦横比に合わせて表示され、映像のサイズが変わった場合も追従します。",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Picture in Pictureを表示していない間は、ウィンドウ向けの描画処理は行われません。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "ライフサイクルイベントはAVKitの",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "AVPictureInPictureControllerDelegate",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": "を",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "delegate",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": "に設定して受け取ります。",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Picture in Pictureの表示中は画面上の",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "code": "sourceView",
              "type": "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text": "を非表示にし、終了時に戻すと、",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "開始・終了時のアニメーションが自然になります。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "inlineContent": [
                {
                  "text": "Picture in Pictureを利用するには、Background Modesの",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "code": "Audio, AirPlay, and Picture in Picture",
                  "type": "codeVoice"
                },
                {
                  "text": "が有効になっている必要があります。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "inlineContent": [
                {
                  "text": "Picture in Pictureの表示中も",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "code": "CameraVideoSource",
                  "type": "codeVoice"
                },
                {
                  "text": "のカメラ映像を送信し続けるには、",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Background Modesの",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "code": "Voice over IP",
                  "type": "codeVoice"
                },
                {
                  "text": "も有効にしてください。",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "有効にすると、SDKはカメラの開始時にマルチタスク中のカメラ利用",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "(",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "code": "AVCaptureSession.isMultitaskingCameraAccessEnabled",
                  "type": "codeVoice"
                },
                {
                  "text": ")を有効にします。",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "有効にしない場合、Picture in Pictureの表示中はカメラが中断され、相手側で映像が止まります。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "name": "Important",
          "style": "important",
          "type": "aside"
        }
      ],
      "kind": "content"
    }
  ],
